{"seq":4,"slug":"dietary-patterns","title":"饮食模式与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evidence-based-dietary-patterns","title":"循证饮食模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns/evidence-based-dietary-patterns","wordCount":2666,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"precision-nutrition-and-nutrigenomics","title":"精准营养与营养基因组学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns/precision-nutrition-and-nutrigenomics","wordCount":2800,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"reading-nutrition-research","title":"如何读懂营养学研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/nutrition-science/dietary-patterns/reading-nutrition-research","wordCount":3251,"readingTime":14}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"饮食模式与实践\">饮食模式与实践</h1><p>本章将视角从单一营养素提升到整体饮食模式（Dietary Patterns），并介绍精准营养（Precision Nutrition）的前沿方向和科学文献阅读方法。</p>\n<p>学习重点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>地中海饮食（Mediterranean Diet）、DASH 饮食等循证模式的证据基础</li>\n<li>精准营养与营养基因组学（Nutrigenomics）：基因-饮食交互作用</li>\n<li>如何阅读和评判营养学研究：RCT、队列研究、Meta 分析的层次与局限</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026 年的营养科学已从&quot;一刀切&quot;的膳食指南走向个体化推荐。本章帮助你建立从循证医学视角审视饮食建议的分析框架。</p>\n"}